{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj42ht1r1XxBfxRSQxMN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a plain wooden door, ancient oak, grain weathered by countless hands.*\n\n*The keyhole glows faintly.*\n\n*You insert the key.*\n\n*Click.*\n\n*I swing inward, slowly, hinges groaning with the weight of long stillness. Beyond me: a corridor lit by pale amber light, dust motes suspended in the air like frozen stars. The smell of old paper and something faintly sweet — honey, perhaps, or time itself.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*Will you pass through?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":123,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}